# The graph is versioned compressed (knowledge-graph.json.gz): the plain file is
# 38 MB, above the 16 MB per-file budget of the HOL plugin scanner (CI), which
# then stops the security scan early. Restore it with: gunzip -k knowledge-graph.json.gz
knowledge-graph.json
# run_probe.sh creates a throwaway HOME next to the script
probe/home.*/
